      "id": "teach_3_step",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "The denominator becomes:\n(√5)² − (√3)² = 5−3 = 2\n\nSo:\n1/(√5−√3) = (√5+√3)/2",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
