      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "The denominator becomes 2.\nThe numerator becomes (√5+√3)² = 8+2√15.\n\nDivide by 2:\n= 4+√15",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
