    "teach_7": {
      "id": "teach_7",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "The book often defines two conjugate ratios together.\n\nLet\nx = (√5+√3)/(√5−√3)\ny = (√5−√3)/(√5+√3)",
