      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "From rationalisation:\nx = 4+√15\ny = 4−√15\n\nSo x+y = 8, and:\nx²+y² = 2(4² + (√15)²) = 62\n\nConjugate pairs make the irrational parts cancel.",
